Thanks @Unturned3. I think one straightforward way is defining a custom class inheriting dspy.Module which create an environment -> run ReAct or any complex agent logic -> remove the environment. Let me know if I miss the requirements.

```python
class BenchmarkAgent(dspy.Module):
  def __init__(self, signature):
     self.agent = dspy.ReAct(signature)

  def forward(self, inputs):
     create_environment()
     output = self.agent(**inputs)
     remove_environment()
```
